<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine govt securities secondary market rates.</title>
<headline>Philippine govt securities secondary market rates.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are secondary market rates quoted by banks on Friday for Philippine government securities. The rates are indicative as maturities are slightly varying.</p>
<p>			     ---------------</p>
<p>  BANK		     RATES BID/OFFER PCT</p>
<p>			    3-mths	   6-mths	   1-year</p>
<p>Bank of America	10.05 / 9.95  10.30 /10.20    10.75 /10.65</p>
<p>BPI			10.01 / 9.90  10.24 /10.20    10.70 /10.625</p>
<p>Citibank		 10.025/ 9.95  10.275/10.20    10.725/10.70</p>
<p>Hong Kong Bank	 10.00 / 9.95  10.275/10.20    10.725/10.675</p>
<p>Metrobank		10.025/ 9.90  10.25 /10.20    10.70 /10.60</p>
<p>Solidbank		10.02 /10.01  10.24 /10.19    10.75 /10.700</p>
<p>StandChart Bank	10.05 /10.00  10.25 /10.15    10.80 /10.70</p>
